.TH WAVE-LATEST 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-latest \- Compare what you have with the newest version in the index. Reports only; nothing is downloaded.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave latest <package> | wave latest \-\-all
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare what you have with the newest version in the index. Reports
only; nothing is downloaded.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-a, \-\-all
Check every installed package
.TP
.B \-\-max\-time <string>
Total time limit for each request (e.g. 40s, 1min)
.TP
.B \-\-connect\-timeout <string>
Give up if the handshake takes longer
.TP
.B \-\-content\-time <string>
Give up if no data arrives for this long
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose
Print each request as it is made

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave latest jq
wave latest --all
wave latest -a --max-time=1min
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
